# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:335
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the rotation degree (<guimenuitem>No Rotation (0 "
"Degrees)</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Left (90 Degrees)</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Upside Down (180 Degrees)</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Right "
"(270 Degrees)</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"परिभ्रमणस्य डिग्री (<guimenuitem>कोऽपि परिभ्रमणं नास्ति (० "
