"<guimenuitem>उल्टा (१८० डिग्री)</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>दक्षिणं चिनोतु "
"(२७० डिग्री)</guimenuitem>।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:341
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Refresh</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>दृश्य</guimenu> <guimenuitem>ताजगीकृत्य</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:345
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the refresh rate (<guimenuitem>Very Low</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Low</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Medium</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>High</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Very High</guimenuitem>). The "
"higher the rate, the more computing power (CPU) will be needed."
msgstr ""
"ताजगीदरं चिनोतु (<guimenuitem>अति न्यून</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>कम</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>मध्यम</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>उच्च</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>अति उच्च</guimenuitem >). यथा "
"यथा अधिकः दरः भवति तथा तथा अधिकगणनाशक्तिः (CPU) आवश्यकी भविष्यति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:353
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Colors</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>दृश्य</guimenu> <guimenu>रङ्गाः</guimenu>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:357
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select different color vision deficiencies to simulate color blindness. "
"This is not useful for people with color blindness, but good for designing "
"accessible interfaces."
msgstr ""
"वर्ण-अन्धतायाः अनुकरणार्थं भिन्न-भिन्न-वर्णदृष्टि-अभावानाम् चयनं कुर्वन्तु "
"। एतत् वर्णअन्धतां विद्यमानानाम् जनानां कृते उपयोगी नास्ति, परन्तु "
"सुलभ-अन्तरफलकानां परिकल्पनाय उत्तमम् ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:366
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Settings Menu"
msgstr "सेटिंग्स् मेन्यू इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:371
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\"> <keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Follow Mouse "
"Mode</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\"> <keycap>F2</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>मूषकविधानस्य अनुसरणं "
"कुर्वन्तु</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:379
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "In this mode the area around the mouse cursor is shown in a normal window."
msgstr ""
"अस्मिन् मोड् मध्ये मूषकस्य कर्सरस्य परितः क्षेत्रं सामान्यविण्डो मध्ये "
"दर्शितं भवति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:383
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\"> <keycap>F3</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Selection Window "
"Mode</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\"> <keycap>F3</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>चयनविण्डो "
"मोड</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:391
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this mode a selection window is opened. The selected area is shown in a "
"normal window."
msgstr ""
"अस्मिन् मोड् मध्ये चयनविण्डो उद्घाट्यते । चयनितं क्षेत्रं सामान्यविण्डो "
"मध्ये दर्शितं भवति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:395
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\"> <keycap>F4</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Whole Screen "
"Mode</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\"> <keycap>F4</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>समग्रपर्दे "
"मोड</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:403
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "In this mode the whole screen is magnified in the zoom window."
msgstr "अस्मिन् मोड् मध्ये जूम विण्डो मध्ये सम्पूर्णं पटलं वर्धितं भवति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:407
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\"> <keycap>F6</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Hide Mouse "
"Cursor</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\"> <keycap>F6</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>मूषकस्य कर्सरं "
"गोपयन्तु</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:415 index.docbook:482
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show or hide the mouse cursor in the magnified image."
msgstr "वर्धिते चित्रे मूषकस्य कर्सरं दर्शयतु वा गोपयन्तु वा ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:419
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\"> <keycap>F7</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Stays On "
"Top</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\"> <keycap>F7</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>उपरि "
"तिष्ठति</guimenuitem>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:427 index.docbook:487
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &kmagnifier; window stays on top of other windows."
msgstr "इति &kmagnifier; खिडकी अन्येषां खिडकानाम् उपरि तिष्ठति।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:431
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &kmagnifier; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"and <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the "
"sections about the <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">Settings Menu</ulink> "
"and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"अतिरिक्तरूपेण &kmagnifier; सामान्यं &kde; <guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> तथा "
"<guimenu>सहायता</guimenu> मेनू-वस्तूनाम्, अधिकसूचनार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">सेटिंग्स् मेनु< "
"इत्यस्य विषये विभागान् पठन्तु /ulink> तथा च &kde; मौलिकता।"

